WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.784
Employees should receive
appropriate support, clear

00:00:03.794 --> 00:00:07.357
communication, and
adequate compensation.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:10.586
A dissatisfied employee
may reduce morale,

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:12.910
productivity, and the number

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.529
of functioning electric fences.
